      "writtenOn": "2026-11-23T08:51:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, this is intentional. There is no fan table for these boards yet. Reusing the YV5 T2 values could lower the fan speed, so I left the fan control config out for now and did not add a temporary one. I will add it once the fan table is available.",
